// Conformance fixture for ta.wma (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.18, Wave 5B-1).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's WMA formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_wma.csv `close` column).
// Linear-weighted: newest bar carries weight `length`, oldest carries
// weight 1; denominator = length*(length+1)/2.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_wma", overlay=true)
plot(ta.wma(close, 3), title="wma3")
